OL,3,GNEWSAM11 shuts after lorry crash and
OL,4,Afuel spillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the M11 has been shut after a
OL,7,Fcrash involving two lorries caused a
OL,8,Ffuel spillage.
OL,10,FThe southbound carriageway of the road
OL,11,Fwas closed between junction 10 for
OL,12,FDuxford in Cambridgeshire and junction
OL,13,Feight for Stansted Airport in Essex,
OL,14,FNational Highways said.
OL,16,FThe crash, which happened at about
OL,17,F05:48 GMT, caused a fuel spillage and
OL,18,Fthere have been reports of debris on
OL,19,Fthe road.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
